# CLAUDE.md — Flask Project Example

## Overview
Example Flask application with SQLite backend and Jinja2 templates.

## Tech Stack
| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Runtime | Python 3.10 |
| Framework | Flask 3.x (Blueprint architecture) |
| Database | SQLite (WAL mode) |
| Frontend | Jinja2 + Vanilla JS |
| WSGI | Gunicorn + gevent |

## Server Control
```bash
./master.sh {start|stop|restart|status|logs}
source ./venv/bin/activate
```

## Harness: Development

**Trigger:** Non-trivial development tasks (3+ steps, multi-file changes)
  -> use `global-orchestrator` skill. Simple questions -> direct answer.

**Scale Modes:**
- Single: 1-file changes -> implementer only
- Reduced: Bug fixes, small features -> analyst -> implementer -> tester
- Full: Major features, new modules -> all 7 agents

**Change History:**
| Date | Change | Target | Reason |
